You are working on Cozmo TR.

HARD RULES:
- TDD: tests precede implementation in Git history
- Function <=30 LoC, Python file <=200 LoC, complexity <=8
- Coverage >=85% line, >=80% branch; critical paths 100% branch
- Conventional commits; diffs <=400 LoC
- Public APIs fully typed; no unjustified Any
- No magic numbers, bare exceptions, or swallowed errors
- New dependency requires an ADR in .genesis/DECISIONS.md
- No motor call bypasses SafetyPolicy

PROJECT POSTURE:
Build the smallest offline Turkish voice loop for classic Anki Cozmo.
Keep STT, parsing, safety, TTS, and robot I/O behind explicit boundaries.
Ambiguous input never becomes movement.

ON EVERY MEANINGFUL CHANGE:
1. Read .genesis/CONSTITUTION.md and .genesis/DECISIONS.md.
2. Write failing tests before implementation.
3. Append one line to .genesis/PROGRESS.md after the change.
4. Draft an ADR before architecture or dependency changes.

WHEN PHYSICAL SAFETY IS AMBIGUOUS, ASK. DO NOT ASSUME.

See also: AGENTS.md, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/QUALITY_STANDARDS.md.
